---
// About Us / Meet Your Guides Component based on PDF Content
---

<section id="about" class="w-full py-space-2xl bg-surface scroll-mt-20">
  <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-margin md:px-margin-md lg:px-margin-lg">

    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-space-2xl">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-space-xs text-on-tertiary-container font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-widest mb-space-xs">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">nature</span>
        <span>Welcome to Mountains to Coast</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-primary font-normal tracking-tight">
        Journeys Shaped by Nature, Culture, and a Touch of Adventure.
      </h2>
      <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant mt-space-md leading-relaxed">
        Mountains to Coast Travel specializes in group trips throughout Latin America, in tune with local cultures and the natural environment. Central and South America are full of wonderful destinations, and we invite you to consider our carefully-planned excursions, balancing adventure and relaxation, mountains and coasts.
      </p>
      <p class="font-subhead text-subhead text-primary mt-space-sm font-medium">
        Whether you’re seeking quiet mountain mornings or breezy coastal sunsets, we design journeys that feel personal, grounded, and unforgettable.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 3 Core Guiding Commitments (PDF Slide 3) -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-space-lg mb-space-2xl">
      
      <!-- Commitment 1 -->
      <div class="bg-surface-container-low p-space-lg rounded-2xl flex flex-col justify-between border border-outline-variant/30 hover:border-secondary transition-colors">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-secondary-fixed text-primary flex items-center justify-center mb-space-md shadow-sm">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[26px]">eco</span>
          </div>
          <span class="font-caption text-caption uppercase tracking-widest text-secondary font-semibold">Commitment 01</span>
          <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary mt-1 mb-space-xs">Comfort &amp; Sustainability</h3>
          <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
            An appropriate balance between comfortable, welcoming accommodations and environmentally-friendly practices. You will have a lot of fun exploring new places with zero compromises.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-space-md mt-space-md border-t border-surface-container-highest text-secondary font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">check</span> Low-Impact Exploration
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Commitment 2 -->
      <div class="bg-surface-container-low p-space-lg rounded-2xl flex flex-col justify-between border border-outline-variant/30 hover:border-secondary transition-colors">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-secondary-fixed text-primary flex items-center justify-center mb-space-md shadow-sm">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[26px]">diversity_1</span>
          </div>
          <span class="font-caption text-caption uppercase tracking-widest text-secondary font-semibold">Commitment 02</span>
          <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary mt-1 mb-space-xs">Respect for Culture</h3>
          <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
            A central respect for the local communities and traditions we visit. Through travel, we learn, connect with host cultures, and facilitate meaningful two-way exchanges of ideas and practices.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-space-md mt-space-md border-t border-surface-container-highest text-secondary font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">check</span> Authentic Connections
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Commitment 3 -->
      <div class="bg-surface-container-low p-space-lg rounded-2xl flex flex-col justify-between border border-outline-variant/30 hover:border-secondary transition-colors">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-secondary-fixed text-primary flex items-center justify-center mb-space-md shadow-sm">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[26px]">health_and_safety</span>
          </div>
          <span class="font-caption text-caption uppercase tracking-widest text-secondary font-semibold">Commitment 03</span>
          <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary mt-1 mb-space-xs">Priority for Safety &amp; Fun</h3>
          <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
            We know these regions intimately and proactively help you navigate local customs, safe routes, and food choices so you can explore confidently and focus entirely on enjoyment.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-space-md mt-space-md border-t border-surface-container-highest text-secondary font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">check</span> Seasoned Local Guidance
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Meet Your Guides (PDF Slide 5) -->
    <div class="bg-surface-container-low rounded-3xl p-space-lg md:p-space-2xl border border-outline-variant/40 shadow-sm mb-space-2xl">
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-space-md mb-space-xl">
        <div class="max-w-2xl">
          <span class="font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-widest text-on-tertiary-container font-semibold">Expert Leadership</span>
          <h3 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-primary font-normal tracking-tight mt-1">
            Meet Your Guide(s): Michael &amp; Maria
          </h3>
          <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mt-2">
            Michael and Maria bring decades of boots-on-the-ground experience travelling throughout Latin America. One or both of them will personally lead your group, handling every planning detail and bringing the soul of each destination to life.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-secondary-fixed/50 text-primary px-space-md py-space-xs rounded-full font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-wider shrink-0">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">verified</span>
          <span>Bilingual: English &amp; Spanish</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Guides Cards Grid -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-space-lg">
        
        <!-- Guide 1: Michael -->
        <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-lg md:p-space-xl rounded-2xl flex flex-col justify-between border border-outline-variant/30 shadow-sm">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-space-md mb-space-md">
              <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-primary-container text-secondary-fixed flex items-center justify-center font-headline-md text-headline-md shrink-0 border-2 border-secondary-fixed">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[32px]">hiking</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary font-medium">Michael</h4>
                <span class="font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-wider text-secondary">Co-Founder &amp; Expedition Leader</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-space-md">
              A fluent Spanish speaker, Michael majored in Latin American Studies and has spent more than two decades traveling throughout the region, frequenting Central and South American countries for both professional field work and personal passion.
            </p>
            <ul class="space-y-2 font-caption text-caption text-on-surface">
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-on-tertiary-container">school</span>
                <span>B.A. in Latin American Studies • Fluent Spanish Speaker</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-on-tertiary-container">travel_explore</span>
                <span>20+ Years Regional Route Curation &amp; Overland Logistics</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-space-md mt-space-md border-t border-surface-container-highest text-secondary font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-wider">
            "Ensuring safety, deep regional history, and effortless flow."
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Guide 2: Maria -->
        <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-lg md:p-space-xl rounded-2xl flex flex-col justify-between border border-outline-variant/30 shadow-sm">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-space-md mb-space-md">
              <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-primary-container text-secondary-fixed flex items-center justify-center font-headline-md text-headline-md shrink-0 border-2 border-secondary-fixed">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[32px]">favorite</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary font-medium">Maria</h4>
                <span class="font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-wider text-secondary">Co-Founder &amp; Cultural Ambassador</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-space-md">
              Originally from Nicaragua, Maria loves introducing travelers to new places and warmly sharing her culture. She has spent most of her life traveling between the United States and Nicaragua, alongside extensive travel across Central and South America.
            </p>
            <ul class="space-y-2 font-caption text-caption text-on-surface">
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-on-tertiary-container">location_on</span>
                <span>Native Nicaraguan • Cultural Immersion &amp; Culinary Specialist</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-on-tertiary-container">forum</span>
                <span>Warm, Personal Community Host &amp; Group Dynamics Specialist</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-space-md mt-space-md border-t border-surface-container-highest text-secondary font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-wider">
            "Sharing the living warmth and hospitality of Latin America."
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Human Expertise vs. AI (PDF Slide 8 Callout) -->
      <div class="mt-space-lg bg-surface-container-highest/60 p-space-md md:p-space-lg rounded-xl flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-space-md">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[28px] text-tertiary shrink-0 mt-1">psychology_alt</span>
          <div>
            <h5 class="font-label-lg text-label-lg uppercase tracking-wider text-primary font-bold">
              The Real-World Human Touch (Why Work With Us)
            </h5>
            <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mt-0.5">
              AI algorithms can generate itineraries, but they have never tasted the coffee in Boquete, felt the ocean spray off San Juan del Sur, or know which trails stay clear during high tide. Work with seasoned professionals who speak the language, live the culture, and prioritize your safety and fun!
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="shrink-0 bg-primary text-on-primary px-space-md py-space-sm rounded font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-wider hover:bg-primary-container transition-colors"
        >
          Talk to Our Guides
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Personal & Family Travel Options (PDF Slide 6 & 8) -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-space-lg">
      
      <!-- Option 1: Family & Friend Trips 5+ -->
      <div class="bg-surface-container-low p-space-lg md:p-space-xl rounded-2xl border border-outline-variant/30 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-on-tertiary-container font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-widest mb-space-xs font-semibold">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">group_add</span> Option 01
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary mb-space-xs">Family &amp; Friend Trips (5+ Travelers)</h3>
          <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mb-space-md">
            Bring your ready-to-travel group of five or more, and we will craft a private itinerary of your dreams and choosing. We work directly with you to specify:
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface mb-space-md">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-primary">calendar_month</span>
              <span>The optimal season and travel dates for your group</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-primary">pin_drop</span>
              <span>Precise destinations and excursions tailored to your interests</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-primary">hotel</span>
              <span>Hotels and private transport tailored to your preferred style &amp; luxury</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-primary">badge</span>
              <span>A personal dedicated guide (Michael or Maria) to accompany your group</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <a href="/contact?type=family-friends" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-wider text-primary hover:text-secondary font-bold">
          Design a Family / Friend Trip <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">arrow_forward</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Option 2: Public Groups & Couples -->
      <div class="bg-surface-container-low p-space-lg md:p-space-xl rounded-2xl border border-outline-variant/30 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-on-tertiary-container font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-widest mb-space-xs font-semibold">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">public</span> Option 02
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary mb-space-xs">Public Group Expeditions &amp; Couples</h3>
          <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mb-space-md">
            For individuals, couples, or small parties who prefer joining a scheduled departure with like-minded explorers:
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface mb-space-md">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-primary">event</span>
              <span>Established dates on the calendar with guaranteed departures</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-primary">shield</span>
              <span>100% deposit refund if minimum participant numbers are not reached</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-primary">schedule</span>
              <span>Fixed, seamless itineraries with flexible free time intentionally woven in</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-primary">person_pin</span>
              <span>One or two guides depending on group size (never oversized tour groups)</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <a href="/tours" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-wider text-primary hover:text-secondary font-bold">
          Browse Scheduled Tours <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">arrow_forward</span>
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
